WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.640 --> 00:00:21.880
The fight for truth

00:00:21.880 --> 00:00:34.240
In a dark world, where truth is hard to find.
Good men rise for justice.&nbsp;

00:00:34.240 --> 00:00:41.440
They bind.
Amidst the evil eyes, immoral people say&nbsp;

00:00:41.440 --> 00:00:44.760
they'll fight for truth
come what may.&nbsp;

00:00:44.760 --> 00:00:52.880
With hearts aflame they take a firm stand.
Unyielding, they raise their hand.&nbsp;

00:00:52.880 --> 00:00:56.840
They see through veils of&nbsp;
deceit, their mission clear.&nbsp;

00:00:56.840 --> 00:01:02.760
They will never retreat in shadows deep.&nbsp;

00:01:02.760 --> 00:01:13.680
Where darkness breeds they plant&nbsp;
their seeds of noble deeds.

00:01:13.680 --> 00:01:20.560
Without fear they'll lead the blind.
'Cuz walking in faith is the answer for mankind.&nbsp;

00:01:20.560 --> 00:01:24.640
They follow the light, they forge ahead.
Their footsteps firm&nbsp;

00:01:24.640 --> 00:01:33.920
no falsehood spread.
And all the chaos whispers loud.&nbsp;

00:01:33.920 --> 00:01:38.800
They speak the truth, they make it proud.
They want to set the captives free.&nbsp;

00:01:38.800 --> 00:01:44.280
Breaking Satan's grip, you see.
For lies may dance and falsehood sway.&nbsp;

00:01:44.280 --> 00:01:52.640
But, good men's voices won't betray.
With every word, they break suffocating chains.&nbsp;

00:01:52.640 --> 00:01:59.000
Igniting hope, wherever doubt remains.
Their conviction pure, their purpose strong.&nbsp;

00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:04.520
They battle with God's armor, all day long.
Through raging storms, they'll navigate.&nbsp;

00:02:04.520 --> 00:02:09.800
With righteousness written on their breastplate.
The spirit burns through them,&nbsp;

00:02:09.800 --> 00:02:22.160
shining bright, guiding lost&nbsp;
souls to the true light.

00:02:22.160 --> 00:02:30.040
So let them rise, these warriors bold.
Their belt of truth, they will uphold.&nbsp;

00:02:30.040 --> 00:02:38.080
In a suffering world, where many deceive.
Good men fight, because their hearts believe.&nbsp;

00:02:38.080 --> 00:02:45.880
With love and light, their missions clear.
To banish darkness, and conquer fear.&nbsp;

00:02:45.880 --> 00:02:54.000
Their hearts ablaze, a fiery might.
They battle demons, day and night.&nbsp;

00:02:54.000 --> 00:02:59.760
With the shield of faith, they stand tall.
Defeating evil, one and all.&nbsp;

00:03:01.920 --> 00:03:10.520
The battle is souls to save.
For every human life, a chance they crave.&nbsp;

00:03:10.520 --> 00:03:22.200
With God's mercy, they heal deep scars.
Transforming lives, like shooting stars.&nbsp;

00:03:22.200 --> 00:03:34.000
No longer bound by Satan's hold,
they find their true identity, their Spirits bold.&nbsp;

00:03:34.000 --> 00:03:42.120
Through repentance they found release.
And embraced a life of inner peace.&nbsp;

00:03:42.120 --> 00:03:57.880
So, let them rise, these warriors brave.
And run the race until you meet the grave.

